<p class="box-legend"><span>Objectives</span></p>

<p>After completing this section, you should be able to</p>

<ol>
    <li>draw the Fischer projection of a monosaccharide, given its wedge&#8209;and&#8209;broken&#8209;line structure or a molecular model.</li>
