<section class="box-example">
<div mt-section-origin="Courses/Athabasca_University/Chemistry_360:_Organic_Chemistry_II/Chapter_25:_Biomolecules:_Carbohydrates/25.04_Configurations_of_Aldoses" class="mt-section"><span id="Worked_Example_25.4.1"></span><h5 class="box-legend" id="Worked_Example_25.4.1-91045"><span class="lt-icon-default">Worked Example 25.4.1</span></h5>

<p>Draw the Fisher projection of L-erythrose and L-Glucose</p>

<div mt-section-origin="Courses/Athabasca_University/Chemistry_360:_Organic_Chemistry_II/Chapter_25:_Biomolecules:_Carbohydrates/25.04_Configurations_of_Aldoses" class="mt-section"><span id="Solution"></span><h6 id="Solution-91045">Solution</h6>

