<p class="mt-align-center"><img alt="DL.png" style="width: 542px; height: 195px;" width="542px" height="195px" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/396237/DL.png?revision=1&amp;size=bestfit&amp;width=542&amp;height=195" /></p>
